*> Integration test (integrator, batch 11; docs/protocol/21 section 5.5.1, 44 section 3.2 and 3.4): a baby piglin takes nothing (its stopHolding differs, 3.4), an adult
*> piglin takes the whole stack of a gold nugget within its reach.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-GAP-PIGLIN-BABY.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY CORESTATE.
 COPY COREAPI.
 01 WS-NAME                PIC X(16).
 01 WS-NAME-LENGTH         BINARY-LONG VALUE 5.
 01 WS-CONN                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ROW                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-KEY                 PIC X(112).
 01 WS-ENTITY-ROW          PIC X(66).
 01 WS-STATUS              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-TYPE                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PROW                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-NUGGET              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DROP                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-X                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-Y                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-Z                   FLOAT-LONG.
 01 WS-YAW                 FLOAT-SHORT VALUE 0.
 01 WS-ONE                 BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-ZERO                BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-ZERO2               BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     CALL "TEST-SETTINGS" USING CORE-SETTINGS
     MOVE 0 TO CS-HOSTILE-MOBS
     CALL "TEST-OPEN-WORLD" USING CORE-SETTINGS
     MOVE 16001 TO CW-TIME
     MOVE "Alice" TO WS-NAME
     CALL "TEST-JOIN" USING WS-NAME WS-NAME-LENGTH WS-CONN
     CALL "TEST-STANDARD-TABLES"
     MOVE CN-PLAYER(WS-CONN) TO WS-ROW
     MOVE "piglin" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ENTITY-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-TYPE WS-ENTITY-ROW WS-STATUS
     MOVE "gold_nugget" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "TEST-ITEM-ID" USING WS-KEY WS-NUGGET
     MOVE PL-X(WS-ROW) TO WS-X
     MOVE PL-Y(WS-ROW) TO WS-Y
     MOVE PL-Z(WS-ROW) TO WS-Z
     CALL "MOB-SPAWN" USING PL-DIM(WS-ROW) WS-TYPE WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-YAW WS-PROW
     MOVE -24000 TO EN-MOBAGE(WS-PROW)
     CALL "GI-SPAWN-RANDOM" USING PL-DIM(WS-ROW) WS-X WS-Y WS-Z WS-NUGGET WS-ONE WS-ZERO WS-ZERO2 WS-DROP
     CALL "PIGLIN-PICKUP" USING WS-PROW
     MOVE "N" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "integration US15 44§3.4 a baby piglin does not take the gold nugget" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 1 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE EN-USED(WS-DROP) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     MOVE 0 TO EN-MOBAGE(WS-PROW)
     CALL "PIGLIN-PICKUP" USING WS-PROW
     MOVE "integration US15 44§3.2 an adult piglin takes the gold nugget (the item is gone)" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TL-EXPECTED-N
     MOVE EN-USED(WS-DROP) TO TL-OBSERVED-N
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT
     STOP RUN.
 END PROGRAM TEST-GAP-PIGLIN-BABY.
 COPY CORETEST.
 COPY BETEST.
